==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid64''' command creates a ControlGrid64 from two [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|ControlPoly4]] and two [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly6.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly6|ControlPoly6]] objects matching on opposite edges.

</translate>
[[File:15.-ControlGrid64.png|300px]]
<translate>

{{Caption|A ControlGrid64 mixing 4-point and 6-point edges}}

==Usage==

# Select 4 connected edges in the [[3D_View|3D View]]:
## A [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly4|ControlPoly4]]
## A [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly6.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlPoly6|ControlPoly6]]
## A [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly4.svg|16px]] ControlPoly4
## A [[Image:Silk_ControlPoly6.svg|16px]] ControlPoly6
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64.svg|16px]] ControlGrid64}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid64.svg|16px]] ControlGrid64}} option from the menu.
# A '''ControlGrid64''' object, is created.

